Package: bjlm
Title: Bayesian Joint Longitudinal Modelling
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Aidan D", "Bindoff", , "aidan.bindoff@utas.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0943-2702"))
Description: Fits Bayesian joint longitudinal propensity-weighted and piecewise 
    change-point models using Pólya-Gamma augmented Gibbs sampling and 
    weighted MCMC. Implements a modular "cut posterior" to prevent 
    outcome-to-propensity feedback. Provides a premium piped declarative API 
    for subject alignment, demographic and longitudinal outcome merging, 
    prior construction, and highly efficient zero-breakpoint mixed-effects models.
